!-----------------------------------------------------------------------
!
! Absorption cross-section ClO: ClO + hv --> O + Cl
! source : JPL-2006
! http://www.atmosphere.mpg.de/enid/2295
! -> Catalogue -> "Halogen oxides" -> "Cl oxides" -> "ClO" -> "JPL-2006"
! Rem1: Quantum yield = 1.
! Rem2: Temperature influence:
!       T dep. according to the formula:
!           crs = crs_on_file / (1+0.0036*(T-294))
!       where crs_on_file are the crs values given in the table below.
!       The cross sections are computed in subroutine CRS_TDEP.
! Rem3: Note that the crs spectrum is highly complex (see JPL-2006, Figure 4-2, p.4-94).
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Begins at wl interval :        79  | Finishes at wl interval :   95
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!  no  from(nm) to(nm)  | crs (cm2) | qyield (0->1) |   Tdep_param1 |   Tdep_param2
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
